WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Quite cunning

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,040
He actually knew how to leave the smell in advance

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,680
Junior Brother Chu is okay

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:05,920
I've been chasing him for half a year

5
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:06,960
He even fell down with Mao Mei

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,520
It's normal if you can't catch it

7
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,360
Just weird

8
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,840
This spiritual beast has been stealing spiritual grass more recently.

9
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,880
It never came a second time in the past day

10
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,400
It seems that this spiritual beast is in great need of spiritual time recently.

11
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,470
Are you going to advance? Brother, don’t worry.

12
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:29,790
Third level wood attribute elixir

13
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,470
It turns out that Junior Brother Chu is still a member of the Fu family

14
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,590
Hide well

15
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:33,950
If my guess is right

16
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,430
This spirit beast is very confident in its speed

17
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,550
And extremely in need of a lot of spiritual time

18
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:54,640
He won't let go of this magic pill.
